<p>Learn how to coat your melee weapons, throwing knives, sling and bow ammo with poison, giving your attacks a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">27%, 34%, 39%, 42%, 46%</acronym> chance to poison the target for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">21, 25, 28, 31, 33</acronym> nature damage per turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. Every application of the poison stacks, up to a maximum of <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">85, 102, 114, 124, 133</acronym> nature damage per turn.</p><p>The damage scales with your Cunning.</p>